<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">We may invest in properties that are acquired &#147;<I>off the beaten path</I>&#148; and not sold through conventional marketing and auction processes. Our investments may be at a
dollar cost level below those in which the &#147;core&#148; funds are interested. </FONT></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:-6px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P>
