<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">We may be more likely to make investments that are <I>outside the &#147;trophy property&#148; category</I>. They may be in need of rehabilitation, redirection, remarketing and/or
additional capital investment. </FONT></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:-6px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P>
