STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><B><I>A property that incurs a vacancy could be difficult to re-lease. </I></B>A property may incur a vacancy either by the continued default of a tenant
