STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><B><I>We may be unable to sell a property if or when we decide to do so.</I></B> We may give some commercial tenants the right, but not the obligation, to
