STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><I>Characterization of Property Leases</I>. We may purchase either new or existing properties and lease them to tenants. Our ability to claim certain tax
