STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">Lightstone Value Plus Real Estate Investment Trust, Inc., a Maryland
corporation (the &#147;Company&#148;), pursuant to its Charter (the &#147;Charter&#148;), has adopted a Distribution Reinvestment Program (the &#147;DRP&#148;), the terms and conditions of which are set forth below. Capitalized terms are defined in
